===Etymology===
{{bor+|ru|cu|*настоѩщь}}, present active imperfective participle of {{m|cu|настоꙗти||to happen; to approach (of time)}}. Compare {{m|cu||настоѩщиꙗ жизнь|this life, this world}}.

===Pronunciation===
