====Preposition====
{{head|ru|preposition}}

# {{+obj|ru|acc|catpos=prep}}
## [[under]], [[below]], [[beneath]] ({{n-g|movement to beneath a location}})
##: {{uxi|ru|[[нырну́ть]] '''под''' [[во́ду]]|to dive '''under'''water}}
##: {{uxi|ru|[[положи́ть]] '''под''' [[крова́ть]]|to put '''under''' a bed}}
## [[under]] ({{n-g|beginning to fall under a condition, state or period of action}})
##: {{uxi|ru|[[попа́сть]] '''под''' [[обстре́л]]|to fall/come '''under''' fire}}
## [[towards]], [[to]]
## [[approaching]], [[slightly]] [[less than]] (a quantitative characteristic, such as weight, age, etc.)
##: {{uxi|ru|[[лет]] '''под''' [[со́рок]]|'''approaching''' forty years old}}
## [[shortly]] [[before]], [[towards]], [[approaching]] (a time)
##: {{uxi|ru|'''под''' [[ве́чер]]|'''towards'''/'''in''' the evening}}
##: {{uxi|ru|'''под''' [[коне́ц]]|'''towards'''/'''in'''/'''at'''/'''by''' the end}}
## in [[imitation]] of, [[à la]]
##: {{uxi|ru|[[раскра́шенный]] '''под''' [[леопа́рда]]|painted '''to look like''' a leopard}}
##: {{uxi|ru|[[га́лстук]] '''под''' [[цвет]] [[фо́рмы]]|a tie '''to match''' the colour/color of a uniform}}
##: {{uxi|ru|[[под стать|'''под''' стать]]|to match}}
